 ; se faufiler"},{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"au petit bonheur, n'importe comment"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"别把这两种药混在一起。","pinyin":"Bié bǎ zhè liǎng zhǒng yào hùn zài yīqǐ.","fr":"Ne mélange pas ces deux médicaments.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"豁":{"c":"豁","pinyin":"huō","lectures":["huō","huò","huá"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["宀","丰","口","谷"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1821","L7-1822","L7-1847"],"chemin":{"hsk":1067,"lire":1060},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"se fendre ; tout risquer ; ouvert","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"se fendre, s'ébrécher ; tout risquer"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"ouvert, dégagé ; large d'esprit","pinyin":"huò"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"衣服上豁了一个口子。","pinyin":"Yīfu shang huō le yī ge kǒuzi.","fr":"Le vêtement s'est déchiré.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"活":{"c":"活","pinyin":"huó","lectures":["huó"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["氵","舌"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0180","L2-0246","L2-0479","L3-0310","L5-0348","L5-0349","L5-0451","L6-0403","L6-0549","L6-0729","L7-1219","L7-1823","L7-1824","L7-1825","L7-1869","L7-2793","L7-4483","L7-4817"],"chemin":{"hsk":246,"lire":113},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"vivre, vivant, travail","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这条鱼还活着。","pinyin":"Zhè tiáo yú hái huó zhe.","fr":"Ce poisson est encore vivant.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 活 par « bruit de l'eau qui coule » : 氵, l'eau, donne le sens, et un élément lu guā donnait le son. Cet élément s'est confondu dans l'écriture avec 舌, qui n'y a donc qu'un rôle de forme. De l'eau qui court, le sens est passé à ce qui bouge et vit, puis à « vivre ».","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 活 as “the sound of flowing water”: 氵, water, gives the meaning, and an element read guā gave the sound. In writing, that element merged with 舌, which therefore plays no part here but shape. From running water, the meaning moved to what moves and lives, and then to “to live”.","roles":{"氵":"sens","舌":"forme"}}},"伙":{"c":"伙","pinyin":"huǒ","lectures":["huǒ"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","火"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0341","L4-0342","L4-0809","L5-0162","L7-1591","L7-1610","L7-1837","L7-1936","L7-4131","L7-4184"],"chemin":{"hsk":518,"lire":511},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"bande, groupe ; compagnon","acceptions":[{"categorie":"M","fr":"classificateur : une bande, un groupe de gens"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"compagnon ; repas en commun"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"来了一伙年轻人。","pinyin":"Lái le yī huǒ niánqīngrén.","fr":"Une bande de jeunes est arrivée.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"火":{"c":"火","pinyin":"huǒ","lectures":["huǒ"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L1-0161","L3-0311","L4-0340","L4-0936","L5-0350","L5-0351","L5-0352","L6-0404","L7-0771","L7-0849","L7-1020","L7-1073","L7-1663","L7-1826","L7-1827","L7-1828","L7-1829","L7-1830","L7-1831","L7-1832","L7-1833","L7-1834","L7-1835","L7-1836","L7-3567","L7-4422","L7-4764","L7-4810"],"chemin":{"hsk":22,"lire":22},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"feu","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"别玩儿火。","pinyin":"Bié wánr huǒ.","fr":"Ne joue pas avec le feu.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 火 dessine des flammes qui s'élèvent en pointes, d'un tracé proche de celui de 山, la montagne. Le Shuowen jiezi le classe parmi les pictogrammes et l'associe au sud, dans la théorie des cinq éléments. En bas d'un caractère, 火 prend souvent la forme de quatre points, comme dans 点 ou 热.","en":"On oracle bones, 火 draws flames rising in points, in a shape close to that of 山, mountain. The Shuowen jiezi counts it among the pictographs and links it to the south in the theory of the five phases. At the bottom of a character, 火 often becomes four dots, as in 点 or 热.","roles":{}}},"惑":{"c":"惑","pinyin":"huò","lectures":["huò"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["戈","口","一","心"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-2485","L7-2846","L7-2847","L7-4908","L7-5089"],"chemin":{"hsk":1068,"lire":1061},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"doute, perplexité ; tromper","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"doute, perplexité"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"tromper, égarer"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这件事让我很疑惑。","pinyin":"Zhè jiàn shì ràng wǒ hěn yíhuò.","fr":"Cette affaire me laisse perplexe.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"或":{"c":"或","pinyin":"huò","lectures":["huò"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["戈","口","一"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L2-0247","L2-0248","L4-0343","L5-0353","L7-1838"],"chemin":{"hsk":246,"lire":252},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ou, ou bien","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Conj","fr":"ou, ou bien"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你明天或后天来吧。","pinyin":"Nǐ míngtiān huò hòutiān lái ba.","fr":"Viens demain ou après-demain.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 或 par « le pays » : 口, l'enceinte, 戈, l'arme qui la garde, et 一, le sol. Ce sens est passé à 國, qui l'entoure d'un cadre. 或, emprunté, veut dire « ou, peut-être » ; on y lit toujours 戈, 口 et 一.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 或 as “the state”: 口, the enclosure, 戈, the weapon guarding it, and 一, the ground. That meaning moved to 國, which puts a frame around it. Borrowed, 或 means “or, perhaps”; you still read 戈, 口 and 一 in it.","roles":{"戈":"sens","口":"sens","一":"sens"}}},"祸":{"c":"祸","pinyin":"huò","lectures":["huò"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["礻","口","内"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0416","L7-1845","L7-5619"],"chemin":{"hsk":1068,"lire":1061},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"malheur, catastrophe","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"malheur, catastrophe"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"获":{"c":"获","pinyin":"huò","lectures":["huò"],"niveau":4,"decomposition"