dj","fr":"affamé, qui a faim"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"famine, disette"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"那时候很多人饥寒交迫。","pinyin":"Nà shíhou hěn duō rén jīhán-jiāopò.","fr":"À cette époque, beaucoup souffraient de la faim et du froid.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"鸡":{"c":"鸡","pinyin":"jī","lectures":["jī"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["又","鸟"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0164","L2-0250","L6-0322","L6-0598","L7-1641"],"chemin":{"hsk":156,"lire":207},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"poulet, poule","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"poulet, poule, coq"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"今天晚上我们吃鸡。","pinyin":"Jīntiān wǎnshang wǒmen chī jī.","fr":"Ce soir, nous mangeons du poulet.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 雞, « l'animal qui connaît l'heure » : l'oiseau 隹, et 奚 pour le son. Une autre forme ancienne, 鷄, prend 鳥 à la place de 隹. La forme simplifiée garde 鸟 à droite et remplace 奚 par 又, simple signe.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 雞, “the animal that knows the time”: the bird 隹, and 奚 for the sound. Another old form, 鷄, takes 鳥 instead of 隹. The simplified form keeps 鸟 on the right and replaces 奚 with 又, a mere sign.","roles":{"又":"forme","鸟":"sens"}}},"即":{"c":"即","pinyin":"jí","lectures":["jí"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["丨","彐","乚","丶","卩"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L4-0358","L4-0472","L5-0359","L7-0754","L7-1885","L7-1886","L7-1887","L7-3961"],"chemin":{"hsk":520,"lire":513},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"aussitôt ; c'est-à-dire","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"aussitôt, immédiatement"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"être, c'est-à-dire : langue écrite"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"请立即回家。","pinyin":"Qǐng lìjí huí jiā.","fr":"Rentre tout de suite à la maison.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"及":{"c":"及","pinyin":"jí","lectures":["jí"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L3-0317","L3-