"zh":"这件事很急。","pinyin":"Zhè jiàn shì hěn jí.","fr":"Cette affaire ne peut pas attendre.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 急 par « étroit » : le cœur, 心, et 及, « rattraper », pour le son. Un cœur à l'étroit, qui court après quelque chose : pressé, inquiet. En haut, 及 s'écrit aujourd'hui ⺈ et 彐 ; 心 est resté en bas.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 急 as “narrow”: the heart, 心, and 及, “to catch up”, for the sound. A cramped heart chasing after something: hurried, anxious. At the top, 及 is now written ⺈ and 彐; 心 has stayed at the bottom.","roles":{"⺈":"forme","彐":"forme","心":"sens"}}},"极":{"c":"极","pinyin":"jí","lectures":["jí"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","及"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0313","L3-0318","L4-0356","L4-0357","L5-0021","L5-0521","L5-0839","L6-0412","L7-1880","L7-1881","L7-1882","L7-1883","L7-1884","L7-3987","L7-3988"],"chemin":{"hsk":383,"lire":379},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"extrêmement ; pôle, extrémité","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"extrêmement, au plus haut point"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"pôle, extrémité"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他极少生病。","pinyin":"Tā jí shǎo shēngbìng.","fr":"Il n'est presque jamais malade.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"棘":{"c":"棘","pinyin":"jí","lectures":["jí"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["朿","朿"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1895","L7-2184"],"chemin":{"hsk":1072,"lire":1065},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"jujubier épineux ; épine","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"jujubier épineux ; épine, ronce"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这件事很棘手。","pinyin":"Zhè jiàn shì hěn jíshǒu.","fr":"Cette affaire est épineuse.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"疾":{"c":"疾","pinyin":"jí","lectures":["jí"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["疒","矢"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0081","L6-0082","L6-0414"],"chemin":{"hsk":804,"lire":797},"sens":{"statut":"relu","g